@startuml
title d locals / diff locals — Display local-variable changes
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor "User" as U
participant "TerminalUI" as UI
participant "DebugSession" as S
U -> UI : d locals / diff locals
UI -> UI : show_diff(locals_only=True)
UI -> S : current_state(); source_expression() when needed
S --> UI : Copied values and original source range
UI --> U : Result or command error; return to prompt
@enduml
